Z||000000||FieroKyle||06-22-2001||04:09 AM||||Heres a pic of my 85' GT. I bought it for $2800 in the fall of 2000, washed and stored it imediatly for the winter. I am the 3rd owner and very proud. I bought the car in mint condition. Well, as I have owned it, I had a flat tire on the front left and it damaged the rocker panel cracking it on the corner. Then one day I look at my car and the quarter window on the right side cracked in two places for no apparent reason. Then after all this happened in the first two weeks I got it out from winter storage, I was changing my oil and noticed the stupid Kelly Charger Tires had worn right through the belts which would explain that very bad vibration i been having, lol. So I took it in the goodyear dealer and had them put Goodyear Eagles GT2 tires all way around. Ever since then, no tire problems. Its needed regular maintence and a few things: <BR>new lamps<BR>oil pressure sending unit<BR>throttle position sensing unit<BR>heater core<BR>ball joints - Moogs<BR>new tires - Goodyear<P>Runs like a dream. My daily summer driver with almost 114k on it. I have added a Pioneer Premier CD player with new pioneer 4x10s in the dash and pioneer premier 6 1/2 in. round speakers where the pockets used to be. still have the speakers in the headrest working and working great. I get alot of comments and have a friend with a trans am that envys my car! hah! lol. Has great interior and no further problems currently.  <P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.photoloft.com/view/Image.asp?s=xpag&u=996101&a=776301&i=4987359<BR>There's" TARGET=_blank>http://www.photoloft.com/view/Image.asp?s=xpag&u=996101&a=776301&i=4987359<BR>There's</A>  my little guy, click and say hi!<P>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||1
Z||000001||FieroKyle||06-22-2001||04:14 AM||||Forgot to mention, <BR>All options on it availble in 85<BR>4-speed manual<BR>cat. converter removed<BR><P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.photoloft.com/view/Image.asp?s=xpag&u=996101&a=776301&i=4987359<BR>There's" TARGET=_blank>http://www.photoloft.com/view/Image.asp?s=xpag&u=996101&a=776301&i=4987359<BR>There's</A>  my little guy, click and say hi!<P>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||1
